full-query: "A Database Engineer is working on a project that involves a multi-tenant SaaS application with a variety of workloads and access patterns. The application is currently using Cloud SQL for PostgreSQL, and the engineer is tasked with optimizing cost and performance. Which of the following strategies should the engineer implement to best achieve these objectives?"
