  "qid": "320",
  "tip": "<p>When a scenario mentions many <i>short lived connections</i> to Cloud SQL and a goal to keep <i>p95 latency</i> steady while reducing cost, think of <i>connection pooling</i> as the smallest change that targets connection overhead without redesigning the data model.</p>",
